[{:db/id [:question/math-academy-id "q-9669"] :question/problem "Find the possible values of the constant $k$ given that the matrix $[\\begin{aligned}2 & 1 & -4 \\\\ 2k+1 & 3 & k \\\\ 1 & 0 & 1\\end{aligned}]$ is singular." :question/worked-solution "First, let's use our formula to find an expression for the determinant in terms of $k:$ \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}|\\begin{aligned}2 & 1 & -4 \\\\ 2k+1 & 3 & k \\\\ 1 & 0 & 1\\end{aligned}| & =2|\\begin{aligned}3 & k \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{aligned}|-1|\\begin{aligned}2k+1 & k \\\\ 1 & 1\\end{aligned}|-4|\\begin{aligned}2k+1 & 3 \\\\ 1 & 0\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =2(3-0)-(2k+1-k)-4(0-3) \\\\  & =2\\cdot 3-(k+1)-4\\cdot (-3) \\\\  & =6-k-1+12 \\\\  & =17-k\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSince the matrix is singular, the determinant is $0,$ and we have:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}17-k & =0 \\\\ k & =17\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the solution is $k=17.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:question/math-academy-id "q-9838"] :question/problem "Which of the following statements are true regarding the matrix $F$ given below?\n\n- $det(F)=0$\n- $F$ is a singular matrix\n- $det(F)=-2$\n\n$$\nF=[\\begin{aligned}0 & 1 & 2 \\\\ 3 & 4 & 5 \\\\ 6 & 7 & 8\\end{aligned}]\n$$" :question/worked-solution "Remember that a square matrix is singular if its determinant is equal to $0.$\n\nUsing the formula, we take the alternating sum of the entries in the top row of the matrix, multiplied by their respective minors, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}det(F) & =|\\begin{aligned}0 & 1 & 2 \\\\ 3 & 4 & 5 \\\\ 6 & 7 & 8\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =0|\\begin{aligned}4 & 5 \\\\ 7 & 8\\end{aligned}|-1|\\begin{aligned}3 & 5 \\\\ 6 & 8\\end{aligned}|+2|\\begin{aligned}3 & 4 \\\\ 6 & 7\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =0-1(24-30)+2(21-24) \\\\  & =0-1\\cdot (-6)+2\\cdot (-3) \\\\  & =6-6 \\\\  & =0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSince $det(F)=0$, the matrix is singular. \n\nTherefore, only statements I and II are true." :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "q-128478/selection/42d3ef8efa6c53354ba5c528c84b74197437e62ea7b017953dfb6ef412bb4cfc" :answer/id #uuid "b8bba62d-fe77-5d81-bcef-93aa7bb31ccd" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "None of the given statements are true" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-128478/selection/1f1f2fe9df6485d5cdc7916416b2f79699d874348406e639d5daec02cb2e57e6" :answer/id #uuid "e4ca2415-9cc0-55d6-a117-9433092650cf" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "II and III only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-128478/selection/5b26512916f768e66a2b0af106e5aa3e2ff7ee012277d9669a26d349c343f77b" :answer/id #uuid "298fd41d-0b67-5dd7-a7f4-b00d36ea9393" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "I only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-128478/selection/95f63c11f99a5015c1f73558576052145e00c1cfbb1718f78cf554be0ab200f9" :answer/id #uuid "80942402-97be-50b4-81e8-4df0f85fbddf" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "I and II only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-128478/selection/df67a18079e3b7b726c109ae1bf07ae161d9f6d37a928c50361c8787d74f7981" :answer/id #uuid "e9a9e36b-c45e-5d89-95dc-ea4a477b71b8" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "II only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-128478/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "c93f4e79-80f7-52a5-9175-9f28ad8128d1" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-128478/selection/df67a18079e3b7b726c109ae1bf07ae161d9f6d37a928c50361c8787d74f7981" :answer-field/choices ["q-128478/selection/42d3ef8efa6c53354ba5c528c84b74197437e62ea7b017953dfb6ef412bb4cfc" "q-128478/selection/1f1f2fe9df6485d5cdc7916416b2f79699d874348406e639d5daec02cb2e57e6" "q-128478/selection/5b26512916f768e66a2b0af106e5aa3e2ff7ee012277d9669a26d349c343f77b" "q-128478/selection/95f63c11f99a5015c1f73558576052145e00c1cfbb1718f78cf554be0ab200f9" "q-128478/selection/df67a18079e3b7b726c109ae1bf07ae161d9f6d37a928c50361c8787d74f7981"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-128478" :question/id #uuid "af5c321a-ef93-52c0-aab1-818de4211e7b" :question/math-academy-id "q-128478" :question/problem "Which of the following statements are true regarding the matrix $F$ given below?\n\n- $det(F)=-7$\n- $F$ is **not** a singular matrix\n- $det(F)=-2$\n\n$$\nF=[\\begin{aligned}2 & 8 & 3 \\\\ -1 & 2 & 1 \\\\ 5 & 3 & 1\\end{aligned}]\n$$" :question/worked-solution "Remember that a square matrix is singular if its determinant is equal to $0.$\n\nUsing the formula, we take the alternating sum of the entries in the top row of the matrix, multiplied by their respective minors, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}det(F) & =|\\begin{aligned}2 & 8 & 3 \\\\ -1 & 2 & 1 \\\\ 5 & 3 & 1\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =2|\\begin{aligned}2 & 1 \\\\ 3 & 1\\end{aligned}|-8|\\begin{aligned}-1 & 1 \\\\ 5 & 1\\end{aligned}|+3|\\begin{aligned}-1 & 2 \\\\ 5 & 3\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =2(2-3)-8(-1-5)+3(-3-10) \\\\  & =2\\cdot (-1)-8\\cdot (-6)+3\\cdot (-13) \\\\  & =-2+48-39 \\\\  & =7\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSince $det(F)=7$, the matrix is **not** singular. \n\nTherefore, only statement II is true." :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-128478/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "32df8909-a239-5167-b8ea-412f7cdaea93"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-128478"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-128502/selection/283bc09f1a097ae8400558511ca45f1013e17c797fdb7407be52694190fd744b" :answer/id #uuid "68b24bc2-38bc-5cf1-a568-635bf94c79e0" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-15" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-128502/selection/5d022a88a643e97abec4d01dfce48411101475c0705a98f29f3a8e3560fb0616" :answer/id #uuid "7c0e1d50-c0da-51ed-9ef3-211ca52408f1" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-10" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-128502/selection/0f0db3a18f1d79c4863315eefe754cc5306e04e7aeebf4414ffedb95d6f1bc97" :answer/id #uuid "7f75060d-2e3e-5e90-9815-cb9194a8788a" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "12" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-128502/selection/954f2b2ecf089f1c43903a74f4575cff67408acc792f8a71c271fa3076456a3b" :answer/id #uuid "c134ccc7-ce69-567f-94f5-e833ae2ba4be" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-128502/selection/0fbe558572ecce67593db00d22f0d8d9d09c98d019451cd13488790a441e6c9c" :answer/id #uuid "fb0d6a44-8436-5525-8cb9-406699916693" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "20" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-128502/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "7400cdc3-34b8-5532-bf3f-8e25d803e6d1" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-128502/selection/283bc09f1a097ae8400558511ca45f1013e17c797fdb7407be52694190fd744b" :answer-field/choices ["q-128502/selection/283bc09f1a097ae8400558511ca45f1013e17c797fdb7407be52694190fd744b" "q-128502/selection/5d022a88a643e97abec4d01dfce48411101475c0705a98f29f3a8e3560fb0616" "q-128502/selection/0f0db3a18f1d79c4863315eefe754cc5306e04e7aeebf4414ffedb95d6f1bc97" "q-128502/selection/954f2b2ecf089f1c43903a74f4575cff67408acc792f8a71c271fa3076456a3b" "q-128502/selection/0fbe558572ecce67593db00d22f0d8d9d09c98d019451cd13488790a441e6c9c"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-128502" :question/id #uuid "e0915dbf-e532-5db3-bdaa-4adfc7076ccf" :question/math-academy-id "q-128502" :question/problem "Given that \n$C=[\\begin{aligned}2 & 3 & 1 \\\\ -1 & q & 5 \\\\ 0 & -5 & 1\\end{aligned}]$ \nand $det(C)=28,$ find the value of $q.$" :question/worked-solution "Let's use our formula to find an expression for the determinant in terms of $q:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\text{det}(C) & =|\\begin{aligned}2 & 3 & 1 \\\\ -1 & q & 5 \\\\ 0 & -5 & 1\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =2|\\begin{aligned}q & 5 \\\\ -5 & 1\\end{aligned}|-3|\\begin{aligned}-1 & 5 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{aligned}|+1|\\begin{aligned}-1 & q \\\\ 0 & -5\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =2\\cdot (q+25)-3\\cdot (-1)+5 \\\\  & =2q+58\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSince the determinant of the matrix is $28,$ we have:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}2q+58 & =28 \\\\ 2q & =-30 \\\\ q & =-15\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-128502/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "ab642ad6-d9e0-5734-83b4-81627b9132eb"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-128502"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-130575/selection/01cb34488ecacd6f03d0c9b731bb7ca2e57e74c7a8567fba8b3705e7dc85c1d6" :answer/id #uuid "0d0cb28e-4fc8-5013-94cf-ff5147e66641" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$-2$ and $3$ only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-130575/selection/53821fba0c67e5bde0b5a8d2780f5551c46e98fecf905e3b05f2764a53c7188c" :answer/id #uuid "31ed3d39-28ce-5447-8827-dde43b2a8108" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$5$ and $6$ only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-130575/selection/ecbb041aa7267f74c26b00faccf3e599a9cbcb9b752b482ff9b3ac4e2f33dff4" :answer/id #uuid "81cfc9c1-3416-5a42-8690-032d7c913f56" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$3$  only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-130575/selection/f6a6e0a6aebfbdda82f61d7a69cce597c75ba33d151a35bee149fdee7c2e8e98" :answer/id #uuid "5b771a52-6452-59ae-8bf1-004cc6984d54" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$5$ and $-5$ only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-130575/selection/56c7f4ebb8f02b8af647e0e93fba67cdcd31d160d829bad7b5f7ec95149ad187" :answer/id #uuid "d58f196e-d677-589c-a2c1-6f3365a23a8d" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$6$ and $7$ only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-130575/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "0e5f0f38-246f-5927-9460-4b2aff199937" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-130575/selection/56c7f4ebb8f02b8af647e0e93fba67cdcd31d160d829bad7b5f7ec95149ad187" :answer-field/choices ["q-130575/selection/01cb34488ecacd6f03d0c9b731bb7ca2e57e74c7a8567fba8b3705e7dc85c1d6" "q-130575/selection/53821fba0c67e5bde0b5a8d2780f5551c46e98fecf905e3b05f2764a53c7188c" "q-130575/selection/ecbb041aa7267f74c26b00faccf3e599a9cbcb9b752b482ff9b3ac4e2f33dff4" "q-130575/selection/f6a6e0a6aebfbdda82f61d7a69cce597c75ba33d151a35bee149fdee7c2e8e98" "q-130575/selection/56c7f4ebb8f02b8af647e0e93fba67cdcd31d160d829bad7b5f7ec95149ad187"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-130575" :question/id #uuid "d07c9ad8-9277-516a-802b-f65168b9d077" :question/math-academy-id "q-130575" :question/problem "Given that the determinant of\n$[\\begin{aligned}2 & 1 & 5 \\\\ 2 & 3 & z \\\\ z & -1 & 1\\end{aligned}]$\nis $-48$, find all the possible values of $z.$" :question/worked-solution "Let's use our formula to find an expression for the determinant in terms of $z:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}|\\begin{aligned}2 & 1 & 5 \\\\ 2 & 3 & z \\\\ z & -1 & 1\\end{aligned}| & =2|\\begin{aligned}3 & z \\\\ -1 & 1\\end{aligned}|-1|\\begin{aligned}2 & z \\\\ z & 1\\end{aligned}|+5|\\begin{aligned}2 & 3 \\\\ z & -1\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =2(3+z)-(2-{z}^{2})+5(-2-3z) \\\\  & =6+2z-2+{z}^{2}-10-15z \\\\  & ={z}^{2}-13z-6\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSince the determinant of the matrix is $-48,$ we have:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{z}^{2}-13z-6 & =-48 \\\\ {z}^{2}-13z+42 & =0 \\\\ z & =\\frac{-(-13)\\pm \\sqrt{{13}^{2}-4\\cdot 1\\cdot 42}}{2\\cdot 1} \\\\  & =\\frac{13\\pm \\sqrt{1}}{2} \\\\  & =\\frac{13\\pm 1}{2} \\\\  & =6,7\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the solutions are $z=6$ and $z=7.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-130575/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "ab642ad6-d9e0-5734-83b4-81627b9132eb"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-130575"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]}]
